# gamelife-core

This crate is pure domain logic. Do not add `rusqlite`, `tauri`, filesystem, HTTP, or `std::env` I/O.

- Dependencies stay `chrono` / `serde` / `serde_json` only.
- Classification is `hint.rs`; slot decision is `judge.rs`; span math is `observe.rs`. Local task types live in `task` / `task_parse` / `task_ai`. Reward keys stay in `ledger.rs` — `settle.rs` in the app crate must call these, not reimplement them.
- Observation beats plan. Auto-Core uses `grounded_strong_core`. Long idle (≥ `LOW_INPUT_IDLE_SECS`, 180s) **is** `Away`, after distraction and before admin / side. `reading_apps` / `CoreReading` are inert; `reading_bridge_seconds` is always 0.
- There is no app whitelist. `trusted_apps` does not gate Core candidacy.
- `screenshot_path` never enters a Judge haystack. `hint` reads `app`, `title`, `url`, `document_path` only — never invent a path from a window title.
- Tests stay in-process. Do not call `std::env::set_var("HOME", …)`.
- Gate: `cargo test --offline -p gamelife-core`.
